--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Container image
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The agent-server container image (packages/agent-server/container/Dockerfile)
is built from ubuntu:24.04 and installs podman, uidmap, slirp4netns,
fuse-overlayfs, and Node.js from NodeSource. Those components retain their own
licenses; run a package-level license audit against the built image if you need
a complete bill of materials for distribution.

The tailored seccomp profile (container/seccomp-builder.json) is derived from
podman's stock profile — see container/gen-seccomp.sh for provenance.
